.TH DWM 1 dwm\-VERSION
.SH NAME
dwm \- dynamic window manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dwm
.RB [ \-v ]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v
Print version, exit.
.SH PATCHES
On top of vanilla dwm 6.8. Diffs in patches\-6.8/.
.TP
.B fixborders
Opaque borders under a compositor.
.TP
.B alwayscenter
Floating windows open centered.
.TP
.B restartsig
Restart action; SIGHUP/SIGTERM handling, see SIGNALS.
.TP
.B moveresize
Move/resize floating windows from the keyboard.
.TP
.B focusonclick
Focus on click, not hover.
.TP
.B hide_vacant_tags
Empty tags hidden from the bar.
.TP
.B monocle_count
Monocle shows [position/total] in the bar.
.TP
.B movestack
Swap focused client with next/previous in the stack.
.TP
.B fullgaps
Uniform, adjustable gaps between tiled windows.
.TP
.B fibonacci
Spiral and dwindle layouts; gap\-aware.
.TP
.B pertag
Layout/mfact/nmaster/bar remembered per tag.
.TP
.B scratchpad
Floating scratchpad terminal, toggled in and out.
.TP
.B swallow
A terminal's window is swallowed by a GUI program it spawns, restored on exit.
.TP
.B swaptags
Swap current tag's clients with another tag's.
.TP
.B volbright\-keys
XF86 keys \(-> amixer / brightnessctl. Not a suckless.org patch.
.TP
.B attachaside
New clients attach beside same\-tag clients instead of becoming master.
.SH KEYBINDS
Match stock dwm defaults. A couple of keys are bound twice, once per
keysym, because which physical key is unshifted depends on the active
keyboard layout \- marked \fBUS/ES\fR below.
.TP
.B Mod1\-p
Spawn dmenu.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Shift\-Return
Spawn terminal.
.TP
.B Mod1\-grave / Mod1\-masculine \fR(US/ES)
Toggle scratchpad terminal.
.TP
.B Mod1\-b
Toggle bar.
.TP
.B Mod1\-j / Mod1\-k
Focus next / previous window.
.TP
.B Mod1\-i / Mod1\-d
Increase / decrease master area windows.
.TP
.B Mod1\-l / Mod1\-h
Increase / decrease master area size.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Shift\-j / Mod1\-Shift\-k
Swap focused client with next / previous in stack.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Return
Zoom focused window to/from master.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Tab
Toggle previously selected tags.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Shift\-c
Close focused window.
.TP
.B Mod1\-t / Mod1\-f / Mod1\-m / Mod1\-r / Mod1\-Shift\-r
Set layout: tiled / floating / monocle / spiral / dwindle.
.TP
.B Mod1\-space
Toggle current/previous layout.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Shift\-space
Toggle focused window floating/tiled.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Arrows
Move focused floating window.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Shift\-Arrows
Resize focused floating window.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Control\-Arrows
Snap focused floating window to that edge.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Control\-Shift\-Arrows
Stretch focused floating window to that edge.
.TP
.B Mod1\-0 / Mod1\-Shift\-0
View / apply all tags.
.TP
.B Mod1\-,\ /\ Mod1\-.
Focus previous / next monitor.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Shift\-,\ /\ Mod1\-Shift\-.
Send focused window to previous / next monitor.
.TP
.B Mod1\-minus
Decrease gaps.
.TP
.B Mod1\-plus / Mod1\-equal \fR(US/ES)
Increase gaps.
.TP
.B Mod1\-[1\-9]
View nth tag.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Control\-[1\-9]
Toggle nth tag in view.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Shift\-[1\-9]
Apply nth tag to focused window.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Control\-Shift\-[1\-9]
Toggle nth tag on focused window.
.TP
.B Mod4\-Shift\-[1\-9]
Swap current tag's clients with nth tag's.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Shift\-q
Quit.
.TP
.B Mod1\-Control\-Shift\-q
Restart.
.TP
.B XF86AudioRaiseVolume / XF86AudioLowerVolume / XF86AudioMute
Volume up / down / mute, via amixer. No modifier.
.TP
.B XF86MonBrightnessUp / XF86MonBrightnessDown
Brightness up / down, via brightnessctl. No modifier.
.SH MOUSE
.TP
.B Tag number: click / right\-click
View that tag / toggle it into the current view.
.TP
.B Tag number: Mod1\-click / Mod1\-right\-click
Send focused window to that tag / toggle that tag on it.
.TP
.B Layout symbol: click / right\-click
Toggle current/previous layout / jump to monocle.
.TP
.B Window title: middle\-click
Zoom focused window to master.
.TP
.B Status text: middle\-click
Spawn terminal.
.TP
.B On a window: Mod1\-drag
Move (floats it first if tiled).
.TP
.B On a window: Mod1\-middle\-click
Toggle floating.
.TP
.B On a window: Mod1\-Button3\-drag
Resize (floating).
.SH STATUS TEXT
Read from the root window name; set with
.BR xsetroot (1).
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGHUP - 1
Restart.
.TP
.B SIGTERM - 15
Quit cleanly.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dmenu (1),
.BR st (1),
.BR amixer (1),
.BR brightnessctl (1)
.SH BUGS
https://github.com/loothmarleck/dwm
